    "turn_text": "I thought was interesting is the vehicle piece and the building piece. I know you mentioned the Shane, but that I think is going to be the next trend of, if not at the national level, state level action, where we saw 100% clean energy targets slowly taking hold across the country at the state level. I don't know the total number now, but something like six or so states have 100% plans, California, New Mexico, Hawaii, there are others working toward it. And now zero missions vehicles and zero missions buildings could be that next sort of rallying cry, I think. I don't know if it'll happen at the national level, but interesting to see it and make it up to that national level discussion.",
