        "text": "One Republican-proposed amendment stating the Paris Agreement should be treated as a treaty and submitted to the Senate did not pass.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "There were 29 amendments offered during the floor debate.",
        "confidence": 0.93
